{"page": 295, "w": 1209, "h": 1868, "lines": [{"t": "269", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.5269, "y": 0.0637, "w": 0.0359, "h": 0.0119}, {"t": "CLOTHES 衣服", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0583, "y": 0.1032, "w": 0.2534, "h": 0.0233}, {"t": "You can wear clothes or you can have clothes on", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0583, "y": 0.1439, "w": 0.4305, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "可以说 wear clothes， 也可以说 have clothes on：", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0583, "y": 0.1611, "w": 0.4327, "h": 0.0134}, {"t": "I'm going to wear my little black dress to the party.", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0561, "y": 0.1831, "w": 0.4439, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "我要穿我那身小巧的黑色连衣裙去参加聚会。", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.0561, "y": 0.2006, "w": 0.3879, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "He's got a very strange hat on.", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0561, "y": 0.2179, "w": 0.2646, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "他戴着一顶奇怪的帽子。", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.0583, "y": 0.2339, "w": 0.2085, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "You can be dressed in clothes, fabric or a particular colour/color", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0561, "y": 0.2573, "w": 0.5807, "h": 0.016}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.2583, "w": 0.137, "h": 0.0128, "t": "ar colour/color"}, {"t": "可以说 be dressed in，后接衣服、某种布料或某种颜色：", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0583, "y": 0.273, "w": 0.4865, "h": 0.0177}, {"c": 0.5, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.2743, "w": 0.0479, "h": 0.0128, "t": "Bit:"}, {"t": "injeans.她穿着牛仔裤。", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.2578, "y": 0.2965, "w": 0.2152, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "She was dressed", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0561, "y": 0.298, "w": 0.1435, "h": 0.0131}, {"t": "all in black.她穿一身黑。", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.2598, "y": 0.3084, "w": 0.2228, "h": 0.0217}, {"c": 0.5, "fill": true, "x": 0.4999, "y": 0.3291, "w": 0.1109, "h": 0.0158, "t": "*****."}, {"t": "in green velvet. 她穿着绿色天鹅绒衣服。", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.2578, "y": 0.3314, "w": 0.352, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "You can put on and take off any sort of clothing. You can also", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0561, "y": 0.3532, "w": 0.5516, "h": 0.0162}, {"c": 1.0, "fill": true, "x": 0.5, "y": 0.354, "w": 0.1073, "h": 0.0117, "t": "lou can also"}, {"t": "穿上/脱下任何一种衣服可以说 put on/take off，也可以用下面的表达：", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0561, "y": 0.3704, "w": 0.6278, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "shrug", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.6816, "y": 0.3997, "w": 0.065, "h": 0.0189}, {"t": "slip into", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5202, "y": 0.401, "w": 0.0897, "h": 0.0177}, {"t": "throw on", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.7915, "y": 0.401, "w": 0.0942, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "pull on", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0803, "y": 0.4018, "w": 0.0747, "h": 0.0175}, {"t": "slip on", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.3697, "y": 0.4022, "w": 0.0722, "h": 0.0168}, {"t": "pull up", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.222, "y": 0.4026, "w": 0.0762, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "into/on", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.6815, "y": 0.4169, "w": 0.0832, "h": 0.0179}, {"t": "匆匆穿上", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.7914, "y": 0.4171, "w": 0.0853, "h": 0.0176}, {"t": "穿上", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.5224, "y": 0.4186, "w": 0.0448, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "穿上：戴上", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0806, "y": 0.4199, "w": 0.101, "h": 0.0164}, {"t": "穿上；提上", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.222, "y": 0.4201, "w": 0.1009, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "穿上；套上", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.37, "y": 0.4201, "w": 0.1009, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "抬臂穿上", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.6838, "y": 0.4345, "w": 0.0831, "h": 0.0177}, {"t": "a coat外套", "c": 0.3, "x": 0.7891, "y": 0.4618, "w": 0.1102, "h": 0.0183}, {"t": "a pair ofjeans", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5199, "y": 0.464, "w": 0.1329, "h": 0.0182}, {"t": "boots 靴子", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0784, "y": 0.4648, "w": 0.1034, "h": 0.0153}, {"t": "a dress", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.2218, "y": 0.4648, "w": 0.0676, "h": 0.0152}, {"t": "a dressing", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.37, "y": 0.4651, "w": 0.0942, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "a coat", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.6816, "y": 0.4666, "w": 0.0605, "h": 0.0131}, {"t": "外套", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.6996, "y": 0.4797, "w": 0.0448, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "gloves 手套", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0804, "y": 0.4801, "w": 0.1083, "h": 0.0181}, {"t": "连衣裙", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.2399, "y": 0.4811, "w": 0.0605, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "一条牛仔裤", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.5381, "y": 0.4811, "w": 0.1009, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "a dressing", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.7892, "y": 0.4811, "w": 0.0987, "h": 0.0174}, {"t": "gown （BrE）/", "c":